# Copy this file to ".env.release" (same folder) and fill in your real token.
# ".env.release" is gitignored and is NEVER packaged into the installer or the source zip.
#
# IMPORTANT: do not put this token in ".env". ".env" ships inside the installed app
# (it carries the Supabase URL and public anon key), so a token there would reach every user.
#
# Create a token at https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   - Classic token: "repo" scope
#   - Fine-grained token: Contents -> Read and write on the repository that receives releases
#
GH_TOKEN=your_github_token_here
